        "commands": {
          "name": "Macro Commands",
          "description": "A list of command objects. Supported keys: changeled (group, rgb, duration), clear, delay (delay), buzz (buzz), set_loops (1–255), loop, and wait. LED groups: TIP, MID_UPPER, MID_LOWER, POMMEL (or 0–3). RGB channels range from 0 to 255; duration is in milliseconds."
